All right!

00:01:38.924 --> 00:01:41.954
You don't have to rush me like that.
I'll be right there!

00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:44.604
What are you doing?

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.434
Hold on a second!

00:01:46.634 --> 00:01:48.804
Phew, I'd better be more careful!

00:01:48.804 --> 00:01:51.244
My secret treasure...

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.074
It'd be a disaster if I misplaced it!

00:01:53.074 --> 00:01:57.974
Episode 4
Magi? It's Stolen?

00:01:59.144 --> 00:02:00.614
Wow!

00:02:03.684 --> 00:02:05.684
What took you so long, Ayumi?

00:02:05.684 --> 00:02:08.424
What do you think about this bath? Not bad, huh?

00:02:08.424 --> 00:02:11.624
It's hard to believe we have a bath
like this inside our house!

00:02:11.624 --> 00:02:15.424
What is this? This is beyond my expectations!

00:02:19.764 --> 00:02:21.604
This feels great!

00:02:21.604 --> 00:02:23.674
I can't believe it can even expand space.

00:02:23.674 --> 00:02:26.344
That's what makes this "magical instant
hot spring" so good, huh?

00:02:26.344 --> 00:02:31.834
The rainy season's over, but it's still humid.
So stuff like this is pretty refreshing, isn't it?

00:02:32.114 --> 00:02:36.184
Big Brother could take a bath with us
if he could just use magic...

00:02:36.184 --> 00:02:40.984
Wouldn't he think it was really weird if he saw
the four of us crammed into this small bath?

00:02:41.324 --> 00:02:43.024
Don't worry!

00:02:43.024 --> 00:02:46.794
No one's as dense as Haruo, anyway!

00:02:52.864 --> 00:02:59.344
Scrub, scrub, making our skin smooth!
Scrub, scrub, making our skin smooth!

00:02:59.344 --> 00:03:03.804
Jeez, you guys are so close it's almost creepy.

00:03:04.114 --> 00:03:07.704
Come to think of it, do you have
any siblings, Ayumi?

00:03:11.484 --> 00:03:14.624
No, I don't have any siblings!

00:03:14.624 --> 00:03:16.224
I see!

00:03:16.224 --> 00:03:17.814
Well, if that's the case...

00:03:18.794 --> 00:03:22.824
We'll share our special bond with you
through skin contact!

00:03:23.134 --> 00:03:24.134
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.
OUR REGULARLY SCHEDULED PROGRAM
WILL RETURN MOMENTARILY
It tickles! Stop touching me!

00:03:24.134 --> 00:03:25.504
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.
OUR REGULARLY SCHEDULED PROGRAM
WILL RETURN MOMENTARILY
Wow, you're so soft, Ayumi!
It tickles! Stop touching me!

00:03:25.504 --> 00:03:26.804
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.
OUR REGULARLY SCHEDULED PROGRAM
WILL RETURN MOMENTARILY
Wow, you're so soft, Ayumi!
How am I supposed to wash you without touching?

00:03:26.804 --> 00:03:29.134
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.
OUR REGULARLY SCHEDULED PROGRAM
WILL RETURN MOMENTARILY
Oh, no, not there!
How am I supposed to wash you without touching?

00:03:29.134 --> 00:03:29.404
Oh, no, not there!
How am I supposed to wash you without touching?

00:03:35.074 --> 00:03:36.234
Haruo?

00:03:37.814 --> 00:03:39.414
No! That wasn't Big Brother!

00:03:39.414 --> 00:03:45.584
That man has some nerve violating
a witch's precious bath time!

00:03:47.094 --> 00:03:50.624
H-Hey, wait! If you use magic like that in here...

00:03:50.624 --> 00:03:52.494
EAT THIS!

00:03:52.494 --> 00:03:53.864
Don't do it!

00:03:56.064 --> 00:03:58.694
Damn it! Looks like he got away.

00:03:59.434 --> 00:04:00.924
What just happened?!

00:04:02.004 --> 00:04:03.494
Is everyone okay?

00:04:06.404 --> 00:04:06.804
M-Maika?

00:04:06.804 --> 00:04:08.144
Big Brother!
M-Maika?

00:04:08.144 --> 00:04:09.074
Big Brother...

00:04:09.074 --> 00:04:11.144
Are you okay? Tell me what happened!

00:04:11.144 --> 00:04:14.684
A Peeping Tom! A pervert was here!

00:04:14.684 --> 00:04:17.154
What? A pervert?!

00:04:17.154 --> 00:04:18.484
Did he do anything to you?

00:04:18.484 --> 00:04:21.024
No, he didn't...

00:04:21.024 --> 00:04:23.324
But he stole all our underwear!

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:25.424
Oh no!

00:04:25.424 --> 00:04:27.034
It's gone! It's gone!

00:04:27.034 --> 00:04:28.734
No way!

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:31.424
It's gone! It's stolen!

00:04:32.234 --> 00:04:34.994
So the only things that were stolen
were underwear, correct?

00:04:35.274 --> 00:04:39.134
Yes, those are the only things that
were stolen from us, but...

00:04:39.304 --> 00:04:40.574
What do I do? What do I do?

00:04:40.574 --> 00:04:43.114
We'll be sure to bolster the neighborhood
patrol in this area in the future,
What do I do? What do I do?

00:04:43.114 --> 00:04:45.414
But don't hold your breath thinking
that we'll recover the stolen items...

00:04:45.484 --> 00:04:47.104
I see...

00:04:52.824 --> 00:04:55.794
I've never seen Mamiya so depressed before.

00:04:55.794 --> 00:04:57.694
What was stolen from her anyway?

00:04:57.694 --> 00:05:02.724
Actually, all she told us was that
it was "an important item," so...

00:05:10.404 --> 00:05:13.064
Lelele no le...

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:18.644
Are you going out?

00:05:25.684 --> 00:05:30.714
Tap... tap... tap... tap...

00:05:46.274 --> 00:05:49.044
Looks like she can't even concentrate
on her work around the house...

00:05:49.114 --> 00:05:51.444
She must've been pretty shaken up by the incident.

00:05:51.444 --> 00:05:54.214
I wonder what kind of expensive item was stolen...

00:05:54.484 --> 00:05:58.824
If you think about it, it's been almost three months
since Mamiya moved in with us,

00:05:58.824 --> 00:06:01.824
but we still don't know much about her.

00:06:01.824 --> 00:06:02.754
Huh?

00:06:02.754 --> 00:06:07.394
You know, stuff like where her family lives
or what they do for living...

00:06:07.394 --> 00:06:09.494
Now that you've mentioned it,
you're right about that.

00:06:09.494 --> 00:06:12.934
Ayumi doesn't seem to want to
talk about stuff like that.

00:06:12.934 --> 00:06:14.604
This is just my guess,

00:06:14.604 --> 00:06:17.274
but the reason she has to work
as a maid at such a young age

00:06:17.274 --> 00:06:20.244
must be because her family
is struggling financially.

00:06:20.514 --> 00:06:23.474
Maybe her parents are ill or something.

00:06:23.474 --> 00:06:25.644
Or they even might already be dead.

00:06:25.644 --> 00:06:29.754
But maybe she's been hiding it from us
because she has a lot of pride

00:06:29.754 --> 00:06:32.384
and her personality won't allow her
to accept sympathy from anyone.

00:06:32.584 --> 00:06:36.824
So the stolen item could be a keepsake
of her parents or something!

00:06:37.024 --> 00:06:39.754
It's very possible.

00:06:40.264 --> 00:06:41.134
He's right...

00:06:41.134 --> 00:06:44.694
She doesn't really have to work
as a maid just because of the curse.

00:06:45.164 --> 00:06:48.634
But her family name "Mamiya" bothers me
for some reason...

00:06:48.634 --> 00:06:51.504
If I put her in my debt now, maybe later I could...

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:53.104
I feel sorry for her.

00:06:53.104 --> 00:06:57.734
I bet her mother even skipped her meals
to buy that thing for her...

00:06:58.984 --> 00:07:02.354
Mamiya lives here with us,
so she's a member of our family!

00:07:02.354 --> 00:07:04.754
Why don't we support her together?

00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:10.624
Lelele no le...

00:07:10.624 --> 00:07:11.264
Mamiya!
Lelele no le...

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:12.124
Mamiya!

00:07:12.394 --> 00:07:15.434
We understand the pain you feel inside very much!

00:07:15.434 --> 00:07:17.464
No, you don't have to say anything!

00:07:17.464 --> 00:07:18.694
Huh?

00:07:18.934 --> 00:07:21.334
We're going to help you!

00:07:21.334 --> 00:07:23.504
So let's try to recover the stolen item!

00:07:23.504 --> 00:07:26.304
No service charge will be applied, okay?

00:07:26.604 --> 00:07:30.814
Well, being depressed isn't going
to bring it back, is it?

00:07:30.814 --> 00:07:33.044
Then all I can do is take the offensive!

00:07:33.044 --> 00:07:34.914
I'm feeling better already!

00:07:35.184 --> 00:07:37.384
Great! Now you're back to your usual self!

00:07:37.384 --> 00:07:40.824
I bet the thief will come back to this house again!

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:42.424
Why do you say that?

00:07:42.424 --> 00:07:43.794
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:43.794 --> 00:07:46.564
There's no way he can forget how
beautiful I looked that night!

00:07:46.564 --> 00:07:48.394
Ah... Refreshing...
There's no way he can forget how
beautiful I looked that night!

00:07:48.464 --> 00:07:49.834
Hey, now...

00:07:49.834 --> 00:07:52.134
Yeah, she's back all right.

00:07:52.134 --> 00:07:56.474
Realistically, I wouldn't think any
offender would come back to the crime scene,

00:07:56.474 --> 00:07:58.704
especially after he was seen in the act.

00:07:59.044 --> 00:08:00.444
Is that right?

00:08:00.444 --> 00:08:04.034
But if you look at it Ayumi's way,
her idea might not be too far off!

00:08:04.344 --> 00:08:08.984
Basically we have to prepare something with a
certain element that he just can't refuse!

00:08:08.984 --> 00:08:12.014
I see! So what should we do?

00:08:13.424 --> 00:08:16.054
We know the perfect person for this, remember?

00:08:16.454 --> 00:08:18.994
You want to know how to prevent crime?

00:08:18.994 --> 00:08:21.934
Yeah. Since we have a bunch of girls
in the house and all...

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:26.864
And I've heard that there are several
police officers in your family, so...

00:08:27.134 --> 00:08:29.034
Hmm, let's see...

00:08:29.234 --> 00:08:31.874
You can easily figure out someone's family structure
by looking at the laundry that's hung outside,

00:08:31.874 --> 00:08:33.844
so try to hang them somewhere
that's not too noticeable.

00:08:34.944 --> 00:08:38.714
Always be sure to lock up the house.
You don't want them to think you're unguarded.

00:08:39.744 --> 00:08:42.714
Placing photos of tough-looking men
in conspicuous places

00:08:42.714 --> 00:08:45.444
is also effective in making
criminals more wary!

00:08:46.724 --> 00:08:49.244
Thank you! That's really helpful!

00:08:49.624 --> 00:08:52.994
Well, it's best to go to your house and give you
point-by-point advice, though.

00:08:52.994 --> 00:08:56.954
His house! This is a chance to go
to Yoshikawa's house again!

00:08:58.004 --> 00:08:59.334
Kurosu...

00:08:59.634 --> 00:09:01.504
Yoshikawa...

00:09:02.504 --> 00:09:04.474
My precious Yuri...

00:09:04.474 --> 00:09:07.464
To tell you the truth, my family
is out traveling today.

00:09:07.874 --> 00:09:11.364
Oh, no... But I'm not emotionally ready for this...

00:09:12.244 --> 00:09:13.444
Yuri, honey...

00:09:17.554 --> 00:09:21.024
Wh-What do I do if that happens?!

00:09:21.024 --> 00:09:23.894
N-No, I'm still gonna be there
strictly for crime prevention!

00:09:24.164 --> 00:09:26.494
H-Hey, Yoshikawa.

00:09:26.494 --> 00:09:29.734
I-If you want me to, I can come by your house

00:09:29.734 --> 00:09:32.734
