measures that fit your needs.

00:09:32.734 --> 00:09:34.874
M-Miss Yuri?

00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:37.704
Yoshikawa left a long time ago.

00:09:40.844 --> 00:09:43.244
O? X??

00:09:43.744 --> 00:09:45.404
First!

00:09:46.544 --> 00:09:51.144
Hang out the laundry in a very noticeable place
so that the offender can see my family structure!

00:09:51.554 --> 00:09:52.724
And!

00:09:52.724 --> 00:09:56.724
Place photos of fragile-looking girls
in a noticeable place!

00:09:56.724 --> 00:09:58.994
This is perfect!

00:09:58.994 --> 00:09:59.864
And...

00:09:59.864 --> 00:10:02.764
Make it look like we don't know a thing
